    "review_status": "source_reviewed",
    "review_scope": "Accepted independent deep audit of main PDF pp.1–5, Figures 1–3, three preparation routes and linked SAXS/optical outcomes; SI and cited upstream methods not reviewed.",
    "missing_fields": [
      "Growth temperature and atmosphere are not stated; 30 °C belongs to seed storage only.",
      "No purification, isolation, yield or product atomic coordinates are reported.",
      "The supplementary SAXS corrections and polydispersity details remain unreviewed.",
      "Final mean length and diameter are shown as plotted SAXS fits without a directly printed numeric endpoint; no exact-size training label is assigned from the plot.",
